# REQUIRES: cuda
# The serial definition of D417 over the lists of units that the device
# builds (D419) against the general build of groups in
# double precision, at the positions of its checkpoint: the forces of the
# pair term (rigid water, Coulomb cut off), within the error model of two
# evaluations of one sum in different orders (Inputs/segments_forces.py).
# TIP3P in a rhombic dodecahedron, and alanine dipeptide in TIP3P, with
# anchors and excluded pairs, all its particles, its bonded terms set to 0 in
# the run (segments_coverage.py, without_bonded) so that the forces are those
# of the pair term alone. A list built without one excluded pair of the solute
# fails. With the first record of the list left out,
# the comparison fails. The oracle's reader of topologies takes them without
# the lines of the preprocessor (the flexible water that they leave out).
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t/dodecahedron/dumps %t/dipeptide/dumps
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_coverage.py system dodecahedron %S/../Driver/Inputs %t/dodecahedron 1 --forces
# RUN: cd %t/dodecahedron && mdir run control.toml > run.log && mdir checkpoint out.h5 --print=forces > forces.txt && mdir checkpoint out.h5 --print=positions > positions.txt
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_coverage.py emit dodecahedron %S/../Driver/Inputs %t/dodecahedron --positions=%t/dodecahedron/positions.txt
# RUN: mdir-opt %t/dodecahedron/harness.mlir --convert-md-exec-to-gpu="dump-segments=true" --convert-md-alg-to-gpu \
# RUN: | mlir-opt %lower_gpu_to_llvm \
# RUN: | env MDRT_SEGMENTS_DUMP=%t/dodecahedron/dumps mlir-runner -e main --entry-point-result=void --shared-libs=%mlir_c_runner_utils,%mdrt,%mdrt_cuda
# RUN: mdir emit --stage=module %t/dodecahedron/control.toml > %t/dodecahedron/module.mlir
# RUN: mdir-kind-pairs-test generate %t/dodecahedron/control.toml %t/dodecahedron/module.mlir 1 0.09582 --func-entry > %t/dodecahedron/entry.mlir
# RUN: mdir-opt %t/dodecahedron/entry.mlir --pass-pipeline="builtin.module(md-check-exchange,md-differentiate,md-expand-truncation,md-inline,convert-md-to-md-exec{skin=0.1},md-exec-fuse-loops,md-exec-accumulate-destinations,md-exec-assign-precision{mode=double},md-exec-assign-algebra,md-exec-assign-storage,convert-md-exec-to-md-alg)" > %t/dodecahedron/alg.mlir
# RUN: sed "/^#/d" %t/dodecahedron/system.top > %t/dodecahedron/oracle.top
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_forces.py emit %t/dodecahedron/oracle.top %t/dodecahedron/system.gro %t/dodecahedron/alg.mlir SOL %t/dodecahedron/probe.mlir %t/dodecahedron/dumps/dump_000000.bin %t/dodecahedron/positions.txt
# RUN: mdir-opt %t/dodecahedron/probe.mlir --convert-md-alg-to-scf | mlir-opt %lower_loops_to_llvm | mlir-runner -e main --entry-point-result=void --shared-libs=%mlir_c_runner_utils > %t/dodecahedron/values.txt
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_forces.py compare %t/dodecahedron/oracle.top %t/dodecahedron/system.gro SOL %t/dodecahedron/positions.txt %t/dodecahedron/values.txt %t/dodecahedron/forces.txt double 0.8 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DODECAHEDRON
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_forces.py emit %t/dodecahedron/oracle.top %t/dodecahedron/system.gro %t/dodecahedron/alg.mlir SOL %t/dodecahedron/drop.mlir %t/dodecahedron/dumps/dump_000000.bin %t/dodecahedron/positions.txt --drop-record
# RUN: mdir-opt %t/dodecahedron/drop.mlir --convert-md-alg-to-scf | mlir-opt %lower_loops_to_llvm | mlir-runner -e main --entry-point-result=void --shared-libs=%mlir_c_runner_utils > %t/dodecahedron/drop.txt
# RUN: not %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_forces.py compare %t/dodecahedron/oracle.top %t/dodecahedron/system.gro SOL %t/dodecahedron/positions.txt %t/dodecahedron/drop.txt %t/dodecahedron/forces.txt double 0.8 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DROP
#
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_coverage.py system dipeptide-gro %S/../Driver/Inputs %t/dipeptide 1 --forces
# RUN: cd %t/dipeptide && mdir run control.toml > run.log && mdir checkpoint out.h5 --print=forces > forces.txt && mdir checkpoint out.h5 --print=positions > positions.txt
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/segments_coverage.py emit dipeptide-gro %S/../Driver/Inputs %t/dipeptide --positions=%t/dipeptide/positions.txt
# RUN: mdir-opt %t/dipeptide/harness.mlir --convert-md-exec-to-gpu="dump-segments=true" --convert-md-alg-to-gpu \
